---
import { INSTALL_COMMAND } from "../../lib/site-facts"
import CopyCommand from "./CopyCommand.astro"
---

<section class="wrap hero">
  <h1 class="h1"><span class="h1-top">Observability workspace</span><span class="h1-sub">for humans and agents.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Metrics, logs and traces across Prometheus, ClickHouse, Loki, Tempo, Elasticsearch and OpenSearch. Ask for a
    dashboard in a sentence and get one that works; search logs and traces in the language each store speaks. Every query
    runs before it is saved.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-row"><CopyCommand command={INSTALL_COMMAND} /></div>
  <p class="hint">
    Installs the observe CLI on macOS and Linux. The server is one binary beside Postgres; it runs in your network and
    sends only the agent's tool results to the model you configure.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .h1-top {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .h1-sub {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.18em;
    font-size: 0.56em;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--mfg);
  }

  .hero-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .hint {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
